  ASSIGN FRAME {&FRAME-NAME} {&VARIABLE}.
  FIND FIRST {&TABLA} WHERE {&TABLA}.{&CODIGO} >= {&VARIABLE} NO-LOCK NO-ERROR. 
  IF NOT AVAILABLE {&TABLA} THEN FIND LAST {&TABLA} NO-LOCK.
  REPOSITION {&BROWSE-NAME} TO ROWID ROWID({&TABLA}) NO-ERROR.
  RUN dispatch IN THIS-PROCEDURE ('row-changed':U).
